        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-6>,
